Edic Aarac.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Edic Aarac''' was an inmate within the [[Imperial Palace]]'s [[Blackstone (Prison)|Blackstone]] prison, during the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Battle for Terra]].{{Fn|1}} 

He was imprisoned there, for committing multiple homicides and other unsavory crimes. After his fellow prisoner [[Euphrati Keeler]] became a member of the [[Order of Interrogation]], Aarac was the first person she interviewed, even as the [[Battle for Terra]] still raged.{{Fn|1}} 

