Edios.wikitext:
{{ScythesOfTheEmperorPortal}}
'''Edios''' was a [[Sergeant (Space Marines)|sergeant]] of the [[Scythes of the Emperor]] [[Chapter]], shortly before the fall of [[Sotha]]. He was one of three officers under the command of [[Hornindal|Reclusiarch Hornindal]] during the aborted crusade to liberate the reliquary world of [[Egottha]] in 990.M41.{{Fn|1}}

When the ''[[Xenophon]]'' was attacked by [[Tyranids]], Edios led his squad in defence of the ship.{{Fn|1}}

Edios fell while defending tech-crews in the burning forward section, though his body was apparently recovered from the flames by his surviving battle-brothers.{{Fn|1}}

