Edoraki Hakon.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Marshal (Imperial Guard)|Marshal]] of the [[Imperial Army]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

Stationed under [[Lord General]] [[Tyana Kourion]]'s as part of the garrison on [[Molech]], Marshal Hakon oversaw the world's '''Northern Oceanic Theatre'''. During the [[Battle of Molech|Traitor invasion of Molech]], [[Grael Noctua]] of the [[Sons of Horus]] attacked Hakon's command bunker, slaughtering all inside. Hakon was badly injured and found on the floor, [[Volkite Pistol]] in hand. Noctua told him that he should aim well, and Hakon fired directly through one of Noctua's hearts. He was then gunned down by the traitor's [[Bolter]].{{Fn|1}}

