Effe Dellius.wikitext:
{{RavenGuardPortal}}
'''Effe Dellius''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] in the [[Raven Guard]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], during the [[Great Crusade]]. He took part in the [[Carinae Retribution]] and was among the Raven Guard's forces that invaded the moon [[Zenith-312]], in order to kill its leader Arch-Comptroller [[Agarth]]. However during the invasion, Agarth unleashed the deadly [[anima-phage]] disease on the moon, which turned the majority of both Zenith-312's population and the [[Imperial Army]] [[Regiment]]s accompanying the Legion, into rageful beasts. This caused them to attack everyone not infected and the Raven Guard soon found themselves vastly outnumbered and surrounded{{Fn|1a}}. Though the Raven Guard were later able to purge the infected on Zenith-312, it is not known if Dellius survived.{{Fn|1b}}

