Egnar.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
[[File:Egnar.jpg|200px|thumb|right|Egnar{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Egnar''' is a [[Longfang]] in the [[Space Wolves]] [[Chapter]], who served in the [[Wolf Lord]] [[Skaldir Ironfang]]'s [[Great Company]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He is a veteran of the [[Chapter]] and the [[Great Hunt]] known as [[Operation Stormfrost]], was among the 115 battles that Egnar took part in. During the campaign, the [[Space Wolves]] attacked the '''Magnavox Ultima''' fortress of the [[World Eaters]] [[Chaos Lord]] [[Ghordane]] and [[Skaldir Ironfang|Ironfang]]'s [[Great Company]] was credited with defeating the [[Traitor Legion]]. Egnar and the [[Pack Leader]] [[Wulfric]], were noted to have served with distinction in the battle, with the [[Longfang]] single-handily holding a breach in the Magnavox Ultima's north wall. As the battle raged, he was able to slaughter all the World Eaters who attacked him, until the weight of their dead bodies eventually rendered Egnar immobile. However the Longfang's heroic actions led to the fall of the fortress' '''Tower of Souls''', which was the real turning point of the battle for the [[Space Wolves]].{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
*[[Operation Stormfrost]] and everything within it, was created by [[Tom Lauten]] and his team at [[Bright Light Studios]] for [[Games Workshop]]. It appeared in [[Inferno! 1]].{{Fn|1}}

