Ehrlan Foss-Chrom.wikitext:
{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
'''Ehrlan Foss-Chrom''' was the first [[Explorator Majoris]], for the [[Forge World]] [[Lucius (Forgeworld)|Lucius]]' [[Explorator Fleet Penta-Gamma 66Z3]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
Its history dates back to [[M34]], when Foss-Chrom was charged with using the [[Explorator Fleet]] to expand [[Lucius (Forgeworld)|Lucius]]' influence. The [[Explorator Majoris]] interpreted this in the most efficient way he could perceive and thus [[Explorator Fleet Penta-Gamma 66Z3|Penta-Gamma 66Z3]] began tracing a spherical route around the [[Forge World]]. This then expanded year by year and gradually brought the Explorator Fleet to more distant [[System]]s. In order to ensure its path was not disrupted by his successors, Foss-Chrom later implanted unbreakable protocol imperatives into the command throne of Penta-Gamma 66Z3's flagship. The Explorator Fleet is still currently active and every succeeding Explorator Majoris has been compelled to rigidly follow what Foss-Chrom considered to be a perfect strategy.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Codex: Adeptus Mechanicus (9th Edition)]], pg. 20 - ''Explorator Fleets''
