Eightfold Harvest Lord.wikitext:
{{KhornePortal}}{{NecromundaPortal}}
[[file:EightfoldHarvestLord.jpg|thumb|right|220px|The {{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
The '''Eightfold Harvest Lord''' is a [[Corpse Grinder Cult|Corpse Grinder Cultist]] whose crimes on the violent world of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] have managed to turn the stomachs of hardened [[enforcer]]s and jaded [[guilders]].{{Fn|1}}

Wrapped in fluttering strips of [[human]] skin, the Harvest Lord's arrival always precedes the spreading of starvation and madness throughout [[Necromunda]]'s [[underhive]]s{{Fn|2}}. Among their many foul deeds was the skinning of numerous members of [[Hive Arcos]]'s population which the Harvest Lord then used to decorated its walls with. This caused terror to spread throughout Arcos shortly before the [[hive]] was successfully invaded by [[Corpse Grinder Cult|Corpse Grinder Cultists]].{{Fn|1}} 

It is unlikely the Harvest Lord is fully human; if it was once mortal it has long since transformed into something else. It is said that the Harvest Lord is drawn to the most vicious acts of murder, eager to spread the blood of the living.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Necromunda: The Book of Ruin]] pg.21
