Ekran Davaar.wikitext:
{{SonsOfHorusPortal}}
'''Ekran Davaar''' was a [[Sons of Horus]] [[Esoterist]], who was among the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s envoy forces on the [[Death Guard]]'s [[Homeworld]], [[Barbarus]], when it was [[Siege of Barbarus|invaded]] during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1a}}

