He was then subsequently among the [[Sons of Horus]] forces, that [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor]] [[Volkus Goraddin]] commanded on the '''Plains of Orthrya''', as the [[Loyalist]]s attacked it{{Fn|1b}}. Owing to their [[Primarch|Gene-sire]] [[Mortarion]]'s hatred of [[psyker]]s, the [[Death Guard]] were loath to employ [[warp]]craft as the Loyalist Primarchs [[El'Jonson]] and [[Russ]] led their Legions against the [[Traitor]]s. Davaar, however, had no such deterrents and when faced with the terrible retribution coming at the hands of the Loyalists, he called forth [[Daemon]]s to bolster the Traitors' ranks. El'Jonson neared his location as he did so, but the [[Dark Angels]] [[Primarch]] and his [[Paladin (Dark Angels)|Paladin]]s were not cowed by the appearance of such monsters. The Primarch then cut a bloody swathe through the Daemons, before killing Davaar and cosigning the [[Esoterist]]'s mangled soul to the mercies of the Warp-spawn he had sought to control.{{Fn|1a}}

