'''Eksander Strix''' was a [[Night Lords]] [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor]], who took part in the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
[[Image:EksanderStrix.jpg|thumb|right|240px|Eksander Strix{{Fn|1}}]]
Born a [[Nostramo]] [[Noble]], Strix became one of his [[Primarch]] [[Konrad Curze]]'s executioners as the [[Horus Heresy]] began.{{Fn|1}}

During the course of the civil war, Strix was among the [[Traitor Legion]]'s forces{{Fn|2}} that attacked a [[Dark Angels]] flotilla at [[Thrassos]].{{Fn|3}} He was later among the Night Lords who were [[Pale Stars campaign (Horus Heresy)|active]] in the [[Pale Stars]], where Strix sought to gain his Primarch's favor. This was as an outbreak of [[Daemon]]s was occurring in the region, which led the Night Lords into fighting a [[Terran]] [[Imperial]] strike force that came to confront it. Strix also came into conflict with the [[Alpha Legion]]'s [[First Captain]] [[Ingo Pech]], who was secretly aiding the Terran strike force.{{Fn|4}}

