Eladen Longstrider.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Eladen Longstrider''' was a [[Asuryani]] [[Ranger]] from the [[Craftworld]] [[Iyanden]], who took part in the [[Horus Heresy]] and was the first to wield the [[Doom of Sorbak]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
During the [[Horus Heresy]], he used the [[Doom of Sorbak]] to kill the [[Word Bearers]] [[Dark Apostle]] [[Sor Bakphal]] on [[Lakaph]]. Doing so proved disastrous for the [[Traitor Legion]], as it allowed the [[Imperium]] to take back the world from the Word Bearers. After Longstrider own death, the Doom of Sorbak has been passed down to numerous [[Eldar_Path#Path_of_the_Outcast|Outcasts]] of [[Iyanden]], who continue to use the weapon to this day.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
