Electus.wikitext:
{{NurglePortal}}
'''Electus the Heir''' is the [[Space Marine Lieutenant|First Lieutenant]] of the [[Plaguebones]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
Though the [[Death Guard]] infected the [[Plaguebones]] and caused their downfall, when they were originally known as the Snakebones, the [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] has since embraced serving the [[Chaos God]] [[Nurgle]]. They hold no ill regard for the [[Traitor Legion]] and Plaguebones' leader, [[Kortharis]], even sent Electus to rally the Death Guard against the [[Imperium]]. The [[Space Marine Lieutenant|First Lieutenant]] then traveled into the [[Eye of Terror]] with a contingent of the Plaguebones' best warriors, to undertake Kortharis' secret mission. This was centuries ago, but since the Death Guard have recently launched a [[Plague Wars|united offensive]], the Plaguebones believe Electus has succeeded in his mission.{{Fn|1}}

