Eleon Iasus.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was the [[Lord Commander (Legiones Astartes)|Master]] of the 22nd Chapter (known as the "[[Nemesis]]" [[Chapter]]) of the [[Ultramarines]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] during the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1b}}

==Biography==
Eleon Iasus was born on [[Macragge]] and originally served in the [[16th Chapter (Ultramarines Legion)|16th Chapter]] under [[Evido Banzor]]. As [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[166th Company (Ultramarines Legion)|166th Company]], he made a point of fighting alongside every squad under his command. [[Marius Gage]] considered him a fine warrior and an excellent captain.{{Fn|1a}}

Shortly before the [[Battle of Thoas]], Iasus was appointed the new Chapter Master of the 22nd "[[Nemesis]]" Chapter by Lord [[Roboute Guilliman|Guilliman]], bypassing the senior Captain [[Hierax]] (who would have succeeded Chapter Master [[Machon Phalaris|Phalaris]] according to the traditions of the 22nd). This was calculated as part of an effort to bring the non-standard 22nd into line with the wider culture of the Legion.{{Fn|1b}}

Iasus was not well received as Chapter Master, Captain [[Sirras (Captain)|Sirras]] going so far as to disobey a direct order not to use heavy weapons in the tunnels beneath the fortress-complex on [[Thoas]], causing the Chapter to suffer heavy casualties when it was buried in a collapse.{{Fn|1c}} Iasus survived and remained in command of the 22nd at the end of the conflict.{{Fn|1d}}

During the [[Battle of Anuari]] and [[Battle of Pyrrhan]] Iasus led the Chapter's famed [[Space Marine Destroyer|Destroyer]] squads into battle.{{Fn|2}}

