===Conflicting sources===
*As a result of his unexpected popularity, Eliphas returned in [[Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War II - Chaos Rising|Chaos Rising]], in spite of his death at the end of the [[Dark Crusade]].{{Fn|2a}}
