Emanad Titus.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
{{Ambig|subject=the Ultramarines Tactical Marine|disambiguation=Titus}}[[Image:TitusSMHeroes.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Emanad Titus{{Fn|2}}]]
{{QuoteBox|quote = '''''"The xenos will charge soon enough. Let us be ready to greet them."'''{{Fn|1}}}}
'''Emanad Titus''' is a veteran [[Tactical Marine]] who has spent over two centuries at the core of the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]]{{Fn|1}}. This has led him to be called '''Old Man Titus''' and he is currently attached to [[Jaenos Sevastus|Squad Sevastus]]{{Fn|2}} in [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Anaton Thassarius]]'{{Fn|1}} [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|2nd Company]].{{Fn|2}}

==History==
Born on [[Iax]], Titus has come to realize his skills lay in advising and not leading. He now knows this role well and has served as an adviser to many [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeants]], who he has shared his wisdom with. Titus does so without seeking a reward and the benefit of his experience has helped forged a path to leadership for many of his [[Battle-Brother]]s.{{Fn|2}} The source of his knowledge comes from facing down every major [[Xenos]] race to threaten the worlds of [[Mankind]]. This has left Titus steeped in battlefield experience and he has never once taken a backward step in his long life. He is currently advising Sergeant [[Jaenos Sevastus]], who consults Titus whenever their squadron faces a new challenge.{{Fn|1}}

