Ember Nostromo.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
'''Ember Nostromo''' is a [[Navigator]] of [[House Nostromo]], who became a [[pirate]] commander in the [[Koronus Expanse]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Before that, the [[Navigator]] served [[House Haarlock]] until it was purged by [[Erasmus Haarlock]]. Ember managed to survive Erasmus' butchery, however, and sought refugee with the outlaw Captain [[Buros Han]]. She would later betray Han in 717.[[M41]], though, and took command of the Captain's warship, the pre-[[Angevin Crusade]] relic ''[[Monarch of Whispers]]''. Ember then became a pirate and gathered together a coterie of [[Rogue Psyker|Warp-witches]] and killers from the hated [[Saynay]] Clan.{{Fn|1}}

Under her command, the ''Monarch'' has become one of the most hated and hunted ships within the [[Koronus Expanse]]. The [[Navis Nobilite]] has placed an enormous bounty on Ember's head for her treacherous perfidy.{{Fn|1}}

