[[File:Bountyinquis.jpg|thumb|right|250px|'''Emil Van Venkman'''{{Fn|1a}}]]
'''Emil Van Venkman''' is a [[Daemon]]-hunting [[Bounty Hunter]] based on [[Orphidia Prime]].{{Fn|1b}}


==Biography==
===Early Life===
It is said that Emil Van Venkman was born on the planet [[Epsilon Regalis]], an ill-fated world made famous by the bloody pogroms unleashed by the [[Witch Hunter]] [[Tyrus]]. Van Venkman joined Tyrus in this purge, and it is rumoured that he denounced his own family to the [[Inquisition]].{{Fn|1b}}

===Orphidia Delta===
When Tyrus left Epsilon Regalis for [[Orphidia Delta]], van Venkman went with him, fulfilling his obsession with punishing deviants throughout the [[galaxy]]. However, there grew fewer and fewer instances where van Venkman's skills were required, and thus, van Venkman struck out on his own to pursue his personal goals.{{Fn|1b}}

===Orphidia Prime===
On [[Orphidia Prime]], van Venkman established a reputation as a brutal killer who achieved his ends by any means necessary, hunting down those who dealt with dark magic and forbidden ways.{{Fn|1b}}

His expertise in unusual cases led to his involvement in cases of extraordinary occurrences, freak events and mysterious deaths, often hired directly by members of the Inquisition.{{Fn|1b}}

It is rumoured that he has taken part in the apprehension and slaying of some of the most infamous [[heretic]]s in the [[sector]]: the burning of the [[Caralase Hive]], the apprehension of [[Jurtoe Dreadelaw]], the killing of the [[Beast of Graia]] and last, but not least, the decapitation of the [[Archfiend of Urthwart]], even though these worlds are many thousands of light years apart.{{Fn|1b}}

