Emilicis van Outrelech.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Marquis Emilicis van Outrelech''' is the [[Planetary Governor]] of [[Sevenhels]] and was present within his palace when it was attacked by the [[Dark Eldar]].{{Fn|1}} 

He hid while the [[Xenos]] massacred or captured his servants and [[PDF|Gubernatorial Guard]], but swears it was his prayers to the [[Emperor]] that led the [[Legion of the Damned]] to appear. The ghostly warriors then killed the [[Dark Eldar]] and Outrelech claims they then disappeared after he dismissed them. The [[Planetary Governor]] says his actions saved the lives of those survivors that escaped the Xenos' clutches; including the baby that would become the [[Living Saint|Saint]] [[Melyssia]]. He does not think Melyssia deserves such a title and instead claims that she is a [[Chaos|hell-tainted]] [[Rogue Psyker|witch]] that deserves to be burnt on an autopyre.{{Fn|1}}

