Emplate.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Emplate''' is an imprisoned [[Aeldari]], that has been made to serve in the retinue of the [[Radical]] [[Inquisitor]] [[Tsengir]].{{Fn|1a}} 
==History==
He was once a proud member of its [[Xenos]] species, until he was captured by the [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] during a battle between their forces. The [[Aeldari]] then fell into the hands of the [[Magos Explorator]] [[Tayschrex]], who had a sinister interest in Xenos lifeforms. This led Emplate to be converted into a living weapon and given to [[Inquisitor]] [[Tsengir]], who Tayschrex also serves{{Fn|1a}}. When sent into battle, he is shepherded by a [[Servitor Imp]] that was created by the [[Magos]], and which was also designed to occasionally torment the imprisoned Aeldari.{{Fn|1b}}

==Trivia==
