''Emplate'', [[Tsengir]] and the rest of the [[Inquisitor]]'s retinue were created by the [[Games Workshop]] employee [[Jake Ozga]] and they were featured in [[Warhammer: Visions 6]].{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}
