Born on [[Terra]], he commanded the Legion in its first major campaign on [[Delsvaan]]. It was under Rathvin that the Legion developed its vicious, fearful, but loyal reputation. When [[Leman Russ (Primarch)|Leman Russ]] was rediscovered, he began to regard Rathvin as unstable.{{Fn|1}}

Rathvin met his end during the [[Wheel of Fire Campaign]] on the world of [[Xyat]]. He was crushed by an [[Ork]] vehicle claw while leading a suicidal charge.{{Fn|1}}

