Erandael.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Count Erandael''', the '''Glory of the Setting Sun''', is one of the triplet [[Corsair Prince]]s that commands the [[Sunblitz Brotherhood]], which he shares with his brothers [[Phaendris]] and [[Siriolas]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
The brothers are furiously loyal to each other and will not allow each other to be insulted by any outsiders. They are also quick to be offended by other [[Corsairs]] and also hold a long-running resentment for the [[Void Dragons]]. Despite their fierce bond together, however, the triplets rarely fight together, as their brotherly rivalry leads them to frequently anger each other. Instead each brother leads their own forces against the lesser [[Xenos]] species, they have such contempt for. Each [[Corsair Prince]], though, has a particular species they target, as it has earned their deepest hatred. It is the [[Orks]] for Erandael, as he sees the species as no better than vermin ripe for extermination.{{Fn|1}}

