Ercuros Tor.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''Ercuros Tor''' was a former [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Imperial Fists]]'s [[5th Company (Imperial Fists)|Fifth Company]], who had served the [[Chapter]] for nearly one hundred and fifty years and also wielded the [[power sword]] [[Sunderer]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
In [[M42]], he led the [[5th Company (Imperial Fists)|Fifth Company]] in a series of successful battles against the forces of [[Chaos]], on [[Osmal II]] and [[Shondarch]]. Sometime later, they would answer a dire [[Astropathic]] warning that a rebellion had broken out on [[Ghyre]] from the Fifth Company [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Larrus Torgan]], who had been stationed on the important [[Mining World]]. One year and twenty-six cycles sidereal later, the Fifth Company arrived at Ghyre aboard the [[Strike Cruiser]] [[Wrathful]]. Upon arriving on its surface, Tor and his [[Command Squad]] met with the Mining World's [[Marshal (Imperial Guard)|High Marshal]] [[Anthonius Kallistus]], to begin planning Ghyre's defense. However before any words could be spoken, [[Epistolary]] [[Aster Lydorran]] sensed a sudden rush of kinetic energy and raised his [[psychic]] defenses to defend against the attack. It would be too late, though, and Captain Tor was slain by a [[sniper]]{{Fn|1a}}. In the subsequent mayhem that erupted, Lydorran discovered the sniper and killed her in vengeance for Tor's death, before she could escape. He would then take command of the Fifth Company, as they did battle with the [[Genestealer Cult|Genestealer]] [[Cult of the Wrything Wyrm]], which was revealed to be behind the rebellion on Ghyre and the death of Captain Tor.{{Fn|1b}}

==Sources==
