Erekan Juric.wikitext:
{{BlackLegionPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] in the [[Sons of Horus]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] during the [[Horus Heresy]]. He later escaped into the [[Eye of Terror]] after the [[Horus|Warmaster]]'s forces were [[Battle for Terra|defeated]] by the [[Imperium]].{{Fn|1}}

Within that [[Daemonic]] realm, he became a [[Chaos Lord]] and created the [[Vaithan Reaver Squad]] Warband, which built a stronghold upon one of the Eye's blighted worlds. The Warband's end came soon after, however, when the Sons of Horus began to be attacked by the other [[Traitor Legions]], who blamed them for the Heresy's failure. The Vaithan Reaver Squad were shattered in such an attack, when the [[Thousand Sons]] [[Sorcerer]] [[Kahotep]] led his Legion's forces to breech the defenses of the Warband's stronghold. Juric knew the day was lost after this happened and, as the Thousand Sons swarmed into his fortress, he ordered the reavers to escape within the Warband's [[Thunderhawk]]s. He did not heed his own order though, as his need for revenge was too great, and after Juric escorted his maimed comrade [[Zhoron]] to the safety of a Thunderhawk, he went to confront Kahotep. By that time, only half of Juric's surviving Warband had escaped, with the others being too bogged down by the Thousand Sons' attacks. Juric could do nothing more for them though, except claim vengeance and asked for the assistance of any nearby Reavers, as he neared Kahotep's position. Three Reavers soon appeared and attacked Kahotep's escorting [[Rubric Marines]], which allowed Juric to reach the Sorcerer. However, Kahotep easily killed the Chaos Lord by using his [[Psychic]] powers to burn Juric alive.{{Fn|1}}

