She is amongst an advisory group of the keenest military minds in the [[Bastior Sub-sector]], who are aiding the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter Master]] [[Calgar]]'s strategic efforts to defeat the invading [[Tyranids]]. If need be, though, Calgar will dispatch members of the group to lead military operations. Such was the case, when Erenice was given command of a relief force and sent to [[Derenis IV]]. Though the Imperial world already had a garrison, it was now in the path of [[Hive Fleet Nautilon]]'s advance. Calgar thought Derenis IV was ill-prepared to defeat an invasion and would need Erenice's resolve to prevail over the Tyranids.{{Fn|1}}

