Erhynica.wikitext:
{{AdeptaSororitasPortal}}
'''Erhynica''' is an [[Order of the Argent Shroud]] [[Celestian]] [[Sister Superior|Superior]], who is part of the Crusade force led by [[Canoness]] [[Eleanor Blanche]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
She was originally a part of a task force, led by a [[Palatine (Adepta Sororitas)|Palatine]], which was fighting in an area, that the [[Great Rift]] suddenly appeared in. The ensuing battles that followed, caused the deaths of many of the task force's [[Adepta Sororitas|Sororitas]], but it soon reunited with other scattered forces of the [[Order of the Argent Shroud|Argent Shroud]]. However, when the task force's Palatine was killed in battle, its command fell to Erhynica who led the surviving Sororitas to safety. They soon joined the Crusade force of [[Canoness]] [[Eleanor Blanche]], where Erhynica and the task force's other surviving [[Celestian]]s, now serve as her bodyguards.{{Fn|1}}   

==Notes==
''Erhynica'' was created by [[Drew Palies]], one of [[Games Workshop]]'s [['Eavy Metal]] painters, for the [[White Dwarf]] magazine's 11th iteration, of '''A Tale of Four Warlords'''.{{Fn|1}} 

