Erika Luminas.wikitext:
{{AdeptaSororitasPortal}}
[[Image:LuminasArt.jpg|thumb|right|220px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|2}}]]
'''Erika Luminas''' is an [[Adepta Sororitas]] [[Palatine (Adepta Sororitas)|Palatine]] of the [[Order of Our Martyred Lady]].{{Fn|1}}  

Known as a ferociously zealous and experienced commander, she manifests [[Saint Katherine]]'s fearlessness in a way that many outside her Order have mistaken for recklessness. Of all the enemies of mankind, those which desecrate holy relics inspire the most rage.{{Fn|2}}

When a [[Warp|sorcerous plague]] began to ravage [[Metalica|War Zone Metalica]] in [[M42]], [[Palatine (Adepta Sororitas)|Palatine]] Luminas and her forces were sent on a vital task to aid the [[Imperium]]. They were charged with finding the bones of an [[Imperial Saint]], which would bolster a protective ward around its [[Sector]]'s most vital Imperial cities. Their search led them to the city of '''Purity''' on [[Martyr's Rest]], which unluckily for them had just been turned into a deadly arena by [[Drukhari]], led by [[Lelith Hesperax]]. This was because the [[Succubus]] intended to use the city, to prove once and for all that she was the best gladiator in [[Commorragh]]. Luminas' forces were then forced to clash with the Drukhari, as the [[Adepta Sororitas]] searched the city for the Imperial Saint's bones.{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

