Erwell Costary.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Erwell Costary''' was a [[Guardsman]] of the [[Phantine Fighter Corps]] active during the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
By '''771.[[M41]]''', Costary was a decorated and famed fighter ace. He was among those Phantine pilots that participated in the liberation of [[Phantine (Planet)|their own homeworld]] when it was invaded and subjugated during the Crusade by the [[Blood Pact]].{{Fn|1}}

On the afternoon of '''220.771.M41''', just prior to the planned [[Imperial]] invasion of [[Ouranberg]], a flight of [[Chaos]] aircraft led a raid on the Imperial positions at [[Cirenholm]] in an attempt to blunt the attack. The Imperials scrambled all of the available planes they could to defend themselves. Although the resulting battle lasted less than an hour, it was exceptionally hard-fought. Nevertheless, the Imperials were able to destroy a lot of enemy aircraft and drove off all of the others before they could land a single blow on Cirenholm. Six Phantine were lost in the attack, including Costary.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
