In 673.[[M40]], Esme led a loose alliance of [[Rogue Trader]] vessels, against the [[Space Hulk]] [[Cauldron of Savagery]]. They fought beside a threadbare contingent of [[Battlefleet Calixis]] defenders and fought the Space Hulk in the [[Drusus Marches]] [[Sub-sector]]'s [[Pellucidan System]]. Their combined forces succeeded in bombarding the Cauldron of Savagery into Pellucidan's sun and saved the System from its nightmarish inhabitants. In reward for Esme's efforts, the [[Imperium]] gifted [[House Chorda]] the freedom of the Drusus Marches Sub-sector. Although repealed a century later for malfeasance, this benefice cemented Chorda as one of the [[Calixis Sector]]'s most powerful [[Rogue Trader House]]s.{{Fn|1}}

