'''Evangelyne Karlzan''' is a [[Radical]] [[Psyker]] [[Inquisitor]] of the [[Ordo Malleus]], who is of the [[Xanthite]] faith and is active in the [[Askellon Sector]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
She was born the [[Shrine World]] [[Ossuar]] and served in the [[Adeptus Ministorum]], until Karlzan's [[Psychic]] abilities were discovered. This led her to be taken by the [[League of Black Ships|Black Ships]], but Karlzan managed to escape after another psyker's power caused them to explode. Some time later, she became an [[Inquisitor]] of the [[Ordo Malleus]], but while Karlzan is still faithful, she is now a [[Xanthite]] [[Radical]].{{Fn|1}} 

Karlzan's [[Inquisitorial Retinue|retinue]] is currently looking into an outbreak of deaths on [[Desoleum]], caused by the usage of the illegal drug [[Spook]]. While they did manage to track down a Spook dealer, they discovered that he had already suffered an explosive death, due to an overdose of the drug. The Spook deaths have now begun to worry Karlzan, as they are similar to the death that freed her from captivity on a Black Ship. Though her retinue continues to search for more dealers, they have been noticed by the dead dealer's associates, as well as an undercover member of the [[Sanctionary]] [[Enforcer (Security Force)|Enforcers]]. Neither group, however, is aware of the retinue's true identities or their connection to Karlzan.{{Fn|1}} 

==Known Retinue==
*[[Sophronia]] - A [[Rogue Psyker]] and former member of the [[Adeptus Administratum]]. She normally leads Karlzan's retinue when the [[Inquisitor]] is not on the field. Sophronia defers to Lazrus during combat though.{{Fn|1}}
*[[Lazrus]] - A [[Voidborn]] [[Hierophant]] of the [[Adeptus Ministorum]], who is obsessed about his ship's key.{{Fn|1}}
*[[Jannasi]], known as "Nasi" - A Highborn Outcast Desperado of the [[Hive World]] [[Desoleum]], who has keen intuition. She also secretly hides her [[Obscura]] addiction.{{Fn|1}}
*[[Isen]] - A novice [[Tech-Priest]] from a [[Feral World]] who still follows his native customs and wears ancestral bones under his [[Mechanicum]] robes.{{Fn|1}}

