Excorius.wikitext:
__NOTOC__
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''Excorius''' was the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Relictors]] [[Chapter|Chapter's]] [[3rd Company (Relictors)|Third Company]], active in [[M33]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|Conflicting sources}}

In '''112.M33''', Excorius led his [[Space Marine Company|Company]] in the [[Feral War]], against the [[psyker]]s of the planet [[Aggaros]]. Fighting through the tribes' [[Pyromancy|pyrokinetic]] shamans, the Relictors uncovered a hidden, ancient city full of statues of the [[Thousand Sons]], each facing an obsidian pyramid bearing a statue of [[Ahzek Ahriman]]. Excorius ordered the [[Chaos]] monument torn down, resulting in the Relictors being ambushed by the statues themselves - in actuality [[Rubric Marine]]s. In the ensuing battle the [[Space Marines]], including Excorius, were killed.{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
==={{Endn|Conflicting sources}}===
The Feral War occurred in [[M33]]{{Fn|1}}, but the Relictors chapter was known by their previous name, the [[Fire Claws]], until [[M41]] (around 150 years before the [[Third War for Armageddon]]).{{Fn|2}}

