Exertraxes.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Exertraxes''' was a [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]] of the [[Astra Militarum]].{{Fn|1}}

In '''397.[[M41]]''' he served as an officer in [[Battlegroup Kalidar]]. Following an [[ork]]ish assault on the Battlegroup's [[Command Leviathan]], the ''[[Magnificence (Leviathan)|Magnificence]]'', Exertraxes was placed in command of a small Militarum force sent to penetrate [[Hive Meradon]] and assassinate the [[Weirdboy|ork witch]] known as [[Greeneye]]. His force consisted of a [[platoon]] of [[Atraxian Regiments|Atraxian heavy mechanised infantry]], a [[Astra Militarum Company|company]] of [[Leman Russ Battle Tank|Leman Russ]] and the [[Baneblade]] ''[[Mars Triumphant]]''.{{Fn|1}}

