Exodus.wikitext:
{{AlphaLegionPortal}}
{{QuoteBox
|quote = '''''"Without a general an army is just an unruly mob. Without a head a general is just a corpse."'''''{{Fn|3}}
|}}
[[Image:Exodus.jpg|thumb|right|220px|Portrait of Exodus.{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Exodus''' was the name given to a famed [[Alpha Legion]] assassin during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

So little information about him is available that none can say whether he was a single skilled individual or a number of assassins operating at the behest of [[Alpharius]]. He was known to have been the most skilled killer outside of the ranks of the [[Officio Assassinorum]]. His marksmanship was said to rival that of a [[Vindicare Assassin]]. Some histories claim that as many as a dozen worlds were brought to compliance with only a single shot fired. By striking down a major enemy commander, Exodus was able to achieve with a single round what an entire war may not have been able to.{{Fn|1}}

His [[sniper rifle]], known as [[The Instrument]], is of unknown design and provenance, and apparently combines advanced bolter weaponry with gravitic acceleration technology.{{Fn|2}}

