Faeruithir.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Faeruithir, Guardian of the Gate''', was an [[Asuryani]] [[Exarch]]{{Fn|1}} from the [[Craftworld]] [[Ulthwé]].{{Fn|2}}
==History==
While serving as a [[Farseer]], Faeruithir took part in the [[Battle for Pandora Prime]]{{Fn|2}} and the [[Pyrus Reach Conflict]].{{Fn|3}} He later became an [[Exarch]] and was among{{Fn|1}} the [[Asuryani]]'s forces that invaded the [[Chinchare sub-sector]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]]. However the [[Imperium]] launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Kith Campaign]] against the invading [[Xenos]]{{Fn|4}} and Faeruithir would become one of its priority targets. The Exarch was also among those that the [[Ordo Xenos]] gathered information on during the conflict, but it was made classified by the Ordo. During one of the Campaign's battles, Faeruithir was captured by the Imperium's forces and was studied by it afterwards. However once the Imperium was done with the [[Exarch]], Faeruithir was executed.{{Fn|1}} 
