Faffnr Bludbroder.wikitext:
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
[[Image:FaffnrBludbroder.jpg|200px|right|thumb|{{PAGENAME}} on [[Macragge]] ]]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Pack Master]] of the [[Space Wolves]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] active during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}

==Biography==
Faffnr served in [[Sesc]], the sixth [[Great Company]] of his Legion.{{Fn|1b}} In the aftermath of the [[Burning of Prospero]], he was dispatched by [[Leman Russ (Primarch)|Leman Russ]] aboard the [[Zeta Class Courier|zeta-class courier ship]] ''[[Waning Crescent]]''{{Fn|1a}} with orders from [[Malcador the Sigillite]] to monitor [[Roboute Guilliman]] and make sure he followed the [[Imperial Truth]].{{Fn|1b}} Upon his arrival at [[Macragge]], however, the Horus Heresy had erupted, and Guilliman was organising [[Imperium Secundus]].{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}} Guilliman accepted Faffnr and his pack (along with scattered forces from a number of other Legions) as part of the garrison of Imperium Secundus.{{Fn|1b}}

Due to the bad blood between the Space Wolves and [[Dark Angels]], Faffnr got into a physical confrontation with [[Primarch]] [[Lion El'Jonson]] upon his arrival in [[Ultramar]] and was easily defeated.{{Fn|1c}}

Later, Faffnr and his Wolves protected Guilliman's "mother" [[Tarasha Euten]] and battled [[Konrad Curze]] when he was loose upon Macragge.{{Fn|1d}} Faffnr was badly wounded by the Primarch but survived.{{Fn|1e}} He was later seen with his Space Wolves monitoring Lion El'Jonson and Guilliman as they conversed on how to capture Curze.{{Fn|2}}

