Fai'sho.wikitext:
{{SalamandersPortal}}
'''Fai'sho''' was an [[Apothecary]] of the [[Salamanders]] Legion during the [[Horus Heresy]], and one of the Unscarred.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Fai'sho was stationed as an apothecary for the garrison on [[Prometheus]]. He was among those chosen by [[Forgefather]] [[T'kell]] to escort the [[Artefacts of Vulkan]]. He supplied medical aid to the rest of the legionairies for the duration of the mission and went with them on ground operations. During the Salamanders attack on the Sons of Horus he was among the squads that entered the [[Wrought]]. He became aware of something being wrong with T'kell and approach to help him. T'kell, who had been corrupted by [[Scrap Code|scrapcode]], shot Fai'sho with a plasma gun. Fai'sho was taken for treatment to the ''Obstinate'' after the Salamanders were taken in by [[Kastigan Ulok]]. [[Saurian]] attempted to save him, but he succumbed to his wounds.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
