{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
{{QuoteBox
|quote = '''''"The wounds that my brethren and I carry are deeper than those that any sword can cut. They are scars of the psyche itself. There is only one salve for such wounds, glorious battle."'''<br>- Fallon, during the [[Surtellan Campaign]]'''''{{Fn|1}}
