'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a member of the [[Dark Angels]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].

===History===
Redloss was originally a native of [[Caliban]], and most of his family was killed by the [[Great Beasts of Caliban|Great Beasts]] that roamed the forest. When he was 8 years old, his settlement was rescued by [[The Order]] and [[Lion El'Jonson]]. The young but determined fighter was selected to become a member of the Dark Angels thereafter.{{Fn|2}} He began his career in the legion as a [[Space Marine Destroyer|Destroyer]] before joining the [[Dreadwing]].{{Fn|4}}

Eventually commanding the [[Dreadwing]], he became the voted lieutenant of the force after recommendation by his predecessor [[Constantine (Dark Angels)|Constantine]]. As commander of the Dreadwing, Redloss was frequently at his [[Primarch]] [[Lion El'Jonson]]'s side. When the Lion arrived at [[Macragge]] Redloss led his honour guard and later helped battle [[Konrad Curze]] when the [[Night Lords]] [[Primarch]] was loose upon the planet.{{Fn|1}} Farith later helped lead the hunt for Curze, personally leading the Dreadwing in the [[Battle of Zepath|attack on the Zepath System]] in the search of the Night Haunter.{{Fn|2b}} He then took part in the hunt for Curze in the Illyrium region of Macragge when the Lion finally cornered the Night Haunter.{{Fn|2c}}

Redloss continued in his role during and after the [[Imperium Secundus]] period, commanding Dark Angels at the [[Battle of Pyrrhan]] and [[Second Battle of Davin]].{{Fn|3}} Alongside [[Holguin]] he was the only [[Hexagrammaton]] commander to survive the escape from the [[Ruinstorm]].{{Fn|4}}

Redloss survived both the Heresy and [[Destruction of Caliban]], and was the one who found [[Luther]] after his battle with the Lion. Becoming the new [[Dark Angels Supreme Grand Master|Supreme Grand Master]] of the Dark Angels, he began an interrogation of Luther that multiple Supreme Grand Masters would continue over the coming millennia.{{Fn|7a}} Eventually however, Farith would be killed by the [[Fallen]].{{Fn|7b}}

