Fasolt.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a member of the [[Imperial Fists]] 12th Squad of the [[4th Company (Imperial Fists Legion)|4th Company]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
[[Image:Fasolt.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}]]
Fasolt fought under the stern gaze of his [[Primarch]], [[Rogal Dorn]], in dozens of wars of [[compliance]], travelling the length and breadth of the rapidly expanding [[Imperium]] aboard the ''[[Phalanx]]''. When Dorn mustered the [[Retribution Fleet]], the 4th Company served along with other [[Space Marine Company|companies]] under the command of seneschal [[Fafnir Rann|Rann]]. During the [[Battle of Phall]], the ''[[Blade of Perdition]]'' led a battle against the [[Iron Warriors]] [[heavy cruiser]] ''[[Sire of Sabaktes]]''. They teleported to the central armoury of the enemy ship and installed a melta charge. When blown up it began a chain reaction and destroyed both the heavy cruiser and its crew. When the surviving legionaries of the 12th Squad returned to the ''Blade of Perdition'', [[Alexis Polux|Polux]] had already given the order to withdraw; characteristic of [[Fafnir Rann]] and his warriors, the ''Blade'' was one of the very last ships to obey.{{Fn|1}}

==Wargear==
Fasolt wore [[Cataphractii Pattern Terminator Armour]] that bore the emblem of double axes on a red shield, which was often used by units under the command of the seneschal Rann. The cross on his right forearm marked him as a [[Veteran Space Marine|veteran]] of his company. The fist and lightning bolts on the left knee pad surmounted on black indicated that Fasolt participated in a campaign led by the [[Emperor]] himself, an honour that many marked for prosperity.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
