Faustus (Space Marine).wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Faustus''' was a [[Space Marine]], who was the lone survivor of an unknown [[Chapter]] that was [[Lost Chapter|lost]] centuries ago.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
This [[Lost Chapter|occurred]] after the [[Chapter]]'s [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]], was destroyed in an attack by [[Xenos]]. Since the lost of his Chapter, Faustus had sworn an oath of penance to destroy any Xenos he encountered and his fury was especially aflamed when fighting [[Aeldari]] [[pirate]]s. This reaction has led [[Imperial]] scholars to speculate that it was the Aeldari, who had destroyed Faustus' Chapter. However it is not known if this was true or not, as he remained silent on the subject. Faustus will now never have a chance to speak on the matter, as he was among the Imperial forces who were slain{{Fn|1}} in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|2}} [[Kith Campaign]], as they fought the [[Drukhari]].{{Fn|3}} While the [[Ordo Xenos]] did gather information on Faustus, the information was made classified by the Ordo. This included the name of his Chapter.{{Fn|1}}
