Federak.wikitext:
'''Federak''' was an [[Imperial Guard]] [[Vox-officer]] who was killed during the [[Exterminatus]] of [[Sepus Prime]].{{Fn|1}}

==Description==
Federak was wiry and short, with the slabby, knocked-about face of a prize fighter.{{Fn|1}}

==History==
By the end of the [[Chaos]] insurrection on [[Sepus Prime]], Federak was the [[Vox-officer]] of Lieutenant [[Sorov]]'s unit. Federak recieved the co-ordinates of a bombed-out gun emplacement that the insurrectionist Governor [[Narbo]]'s shuttle was due to fly over, from loyalist pilot [[Gorny]], who had infiltrated Narbo's inner circle.{{Fn|1}}

While most of the regiment pushed to take the civitate, they moved into position to ambush Narbo's [[Aquila Lander]], in an attempt to fragment the insurrectionist forces. Sorov got Federak to contact Sergeant [[Kapek]] whose force was under attack at [[Tadmor Ridge]], to get him to hold their position while they waited for the Lander to appear. When it did, it was shot down, but Narbo survived and transformed into a [[Chaos Spawn]], killing everyone except Federak, Sorov, and [[Sanctioned Psyker]] [[Glutt]] who managed to destroy the Spawn.{{Fn|1}}

Sorov ordered Federak to broadcast the Governor's death to the insurrectionists, which he announced on every channel. Sorov asked Federak to contact Sergeant [[Baranov]] in the barracks, but heard from Baranov that despite Narbo's death Commander [[Ortegal]] had ordered the planet to be [[Virus Bomb]]ed, including all Imperial Guard regiments stationed there. Federak was killed during the Virus Bombing that followed.{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
===Notes===
*Lieutenant [[Sorov]] said to his unit "you might even get off this rancid planet", implying that their regiment was not from [[Sepus Prime]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
