Ferron Voor.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Ferron Voor''' is an undead [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromundan]] [[human]], favoured of [[Karloth Valois]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
{{Spoiler|source=The Redeemer (Graphic Novel)}}
Voor was sent as the Emissary of Karloth Valois to [[The Caller]] as the [[Ratskin]] shaman was leading his uprising against the [[Hive_Primus#The_Spire|Spire]].{{Fn|1}}

In order to help the Caller fulfil the prophecy that would see the spire toppled, Ferron used his necromantic powers to reanimate the desiccated remains of the [[Rat God]].{{Fn|1}}

This would be his final action, as he was shortly thereafter thrown into the jaws of the raging undead giant rat by [[Klovis the Redeemer]].{{Fn|1}}

==Powers==
As a favoured of Karloth Valois, Voor displayed the ability to control [[Plague Zombie]]s, talk through them from afar and the power to drain life energy and reinfuse it into dead beings.{{Fn|1}}

