'''Finn Goresson''' was a [[Wolf Lord]] of the [[Space Wolves]].{{Fn|1}}

Notoriously fierce and stubborn, he famously led the six month long boarding action against the [[Ork Battleship]] ''[[Starkrusha]]''.  In the end Finn decapitated the Ork [[Warboss]], [[Godstompa]], and afterwards wore the greenskin's head on his belt.{{Fn|1}}

