Fioros Loth.wikitext:
{{AssassinorumPortal}}
'''Fioros Loth{{Fn|1}}, Codename ''Jester'',''' is a [[Culexus Assassin]] who served in [[Execution Force|Execution Force Regnum Tribunal]]{{Fn|2a}}, which was sent to kill the [[Shriven (Warband)|Shriven]] [[Chaos Lord|Sorcerer Lord]], [[Argento Corian]].{{Fn|2b}}

After the [[Vindicare]] [[Moritan Callen‎]] failed to kill [[Argento Corian|Corian]] on [[Bairsten Prime]]{{Fn|2c}}, the Execution Force had no choice but to invade the [[Shriven (Warband)|Shriven]]'s stronghold on [[Dessah]]. Luckily this occurred during the closing moments of the [[War of the Spider]], as Corian and his ally [[Fabius Bile]]'s numerous foes invaded the world as well. In the massive melee that followed, Callen attempted to kill Corian again, but was fatally burned by the [[Chaos Lord|Sorcerer Lord]]'s [[warp]]-fire. The [[Callidus]] [[Zara Nox‎]]‎ was then able to wound Corian, before he flung her away, but in doing so he left himself open to Fioros. Drawing near to the Sorcerer Lord, the [[Culexus]] struck and robbed Corian of his [[psychic]] might. This allowed the [[Eversor]] [[Artiom Wendyl‎]] to severely wound Corian, before the Sorcerer Lord broke his neck. The Eversor's death, however, caused his body to explode, which finally killed the Sorcerer Lord. With their mission complete, Fioros and a wounded Zara made their escape, as the remnants of the Shriven fought to survive.{{Fn|2b}}

