Foedral Fell.wikitext:
{{WordBearersPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a commander of the [[Word Bearers]] active during the [[Horus Heresy]]. A brutal sneering warrior known to have little honour, Vondar was selected by Erebus as one of the recipients of the athames forged from the Anathame, prior to the [[Battle of Calth]].{{Fn|3}} In the closing stages of the battle, he led a major but ultimately unsuccessful counterattack against [[Ultramarines]] forces on the surface of [[Calth]].{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Underworld War]], Fell commanded a major stronghold on Calth's surface, but he and his several thousand legionaries were sacrificed by [[Maloq Kartho]] as part of the latter's plan to ascend to [[daemonhood]]. When Ultramarines [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Remus Ventanus]] arrived with a sizable force to purge the Word Bearers stronghold, Fell and all of his slaughtered men arose as [[Possessed (Chaos Space Marines)|Possessed Marines]] and attacked. Ventanus was nearly killed by the daemonic Fell, but was saved by [[Eikos Lamiad]] and the [[Venerable Dreadnought]] [[Telemechrus]], the latter of whom obliterated Fell's body with his [[assault cannon]].{{Fn|2}}

