Forgotten Company.wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
The '''Forgotten Company''' is a [[Freeblade Lance]] of wandering outcast [[Imperial Knight|Knights]], who are commanded by [[Halenna Terryn]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
Its [[Imperial Knight|Knights]] have fought so long and successfully together, that the Forgotten Company have gained a famed notoriety that equals that of a [[Knight House]]. This has led newly exiled [[Freeblade Knight|Freeblade]]s to seek out the Forgotten Company, and other [[Freeblade Lance]]s with similar reputations, in order to join them. By doing so, they have a chance to earn again the redemption and glory that all such Freeblades crave.{{Fn|1b}}

During the [[Charadon Campaign]], the [[Forgotten Company]] became trapped within the [[Metalica System]], when [[Typhus the Traveler]]'s forces invaded it. In the ensuing war, the [[Freeblade Knight|Freeblades]] combined their unconventional blend of light, medium and heavyweight [[Imperial Knight|Knight suits]] with audacious - some might say insane - battlefield strategy. The Forgotten Company would clash with the [[Traitor Titan]]s of [[Legio Morbidus]] and triumphed on repeated battlefields.{{Fn|1a}}

