Forsithe.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
[[Imperial Navy Captain|Captain]] '''Forsithe''' is the commander of the [[Imperial Navy]] vessel the ''[[Baleful Gaze]]'', part of [[Battlefleet Ultima Primus]], which serves in the [[Ultima Segmentum]].{{Fn|1c}}


==Biography==
When the Battlefleet's flagship, the ''[[Enduring Blade]]'', received a request for aid from the planet [[Dolumar IV]], which was under attack by the [[T'au]]{{Fn|1a}}, the fleet responded and engaged the T'au warship ''[[Or'es Tash'var]]''. The fleet fired upon the T'au ship to disable it and reclaim the [[Ethereal]] [[Ko'vash]], who had just been freed from Dolumar IV's prison complex, by boarding it.{{Fn|1b}}

To Forsithe's and the [[Battlefleet|Battlefleet's]] surprise, their boarding attack was beaten back by the T'au and a large flotilla of T'au warships arrived in the [[system]] to save the ''Or'es Tash'var'' and Ko'vash. The T'au ships greatly outnumbered the Battlefleet and in the ensuing battle the ''[[Reverus]]'', one of the battlefleet's ships, was destroyed{{Fn|1c}} and the ''Enduring Blade'' was successfully boarded. [[Admiral|Lord Admiral]] [[Benedil Constantine]], commander of the ''Enduring Blade'', was pressured to open diplomatic talks with the T'au on his battleship, but they didn't get far before the Planetary Governor of Dolumar IV, [[Meyloch Severus]], barged into the room and declared there would be no peace talks between the T'au and [[Imperium]].{{Fn|1d}}

Severus, secretly a [[heretic]], completed a Chaos ritual and a [[Warp]] portal appeared, allowing a [[Chaos]] warhost to materialize on the ''Enduring Blade''. The Admiral and the Ethereal were captured during the subsequent attack{{Fn|1d}} and as the [[Chaos Space Marine]]s and [[Daemon]]s of the warhost overran the battleship, [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Jehnnus Ardias|Ardias]] of the [[Ultramarines]] stationed aboard the ''Enduring Blade'', declared that the battleship was lost and ordered its evacuation of all surviving T'au and Imperial forces.{{Fn|1d}} When the last of the escape pods launched from the doomed battleship, the ''[[Purgatus (Battleship)|Purgatus]]'', another ship in the Battlefleet, opened fire upon the ''Enduring Blade'', destroying it and bringing an ignoble end to its illustrious career. After the ''Enduring Blade's'' destruction, Forsithe and the remaining Captains of the Battlefleet deployed what troops they had onto Dolumar IV, along with the Tau, to reinforce Captain Ardias' [[Space Marine Company|Company]], after the Chaos warhost invaded the planet.{{Fn|1e}} When the Chaos threat had been dealt with, the Battlefleet and the T'au parted ways peacefully and Captain Forsithe directed the ''Baleful Gaze'' to fire upon Dolumar IV: Captain Ardias deemed the planet had been too corrupted to save and ordered the Battlefleet to begin an [[Exterminatus]].{{Fn|1f}}

