Fortis.wikitext:
{{EcclesiarchyPortal}}
[[Image:CardinalFortis.jpg|thumb|right|220px|Cardinal Fortis{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Fortis''' is a [[Cardinal]] of the [[Ecclesiarchy]].{{Fn|1}}

Serving in the [[Calixis Sector]], Fortis oversees the periphery and nearby [[Halo Stars]].  He governs his diocese from the heavy modified [[Lunar Class Cruiser]] ''[[Pax Calixis]]'' hooked up to machinery that keeps his elderly body alive.  He has little to do with the politics of the Sector [[Holy Synod|Synod]], instead insisting that new areas of the [[Koronus Expanse]] be explored and opened up to the Faith.  He intends to eventually move to [[Port Wander]] and built an enormous cathedral to the [[Emperor of Mankind|Emperor]] for pilgrims and [[Missionaries]] passing through the Expanse.  However, this has brought him into conflict with the Port Wanderer Cardinal [[Kregory]].  He is considering revealing the secrets of the failed [[Margin Crusade]] in order to weaken his rivals.{{Fn|1}}

