==Overview==
Frenk is attempting to gather support within the [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] to brand [[Archmagos Dominus]] [[Belisarius Cawl|Cawl]] as a [[heretek]]. The impetus for this is partially due to the Archmagos breaking into an Cehen-qui's Inquisitorial fortress to liberate a xenos prisoner.{{Fn|1a}} The prisoner is [[AsanethAyu]], a [[Necron]] [[cryptek]], and is now held in Cawl's custody.{{Fn|1b}}

Frenk would attend Cawl's [[Conclave Chronalis]] uninvited and attempt to hold an impromptu trial of the Archmagos.{{Fn|1c}} Frenk would attempt to hold [[Qvo]] in custody during a heretek and [[Chaos]] ambush during the conclave meeting.{{Fn|1d}}  Frenk's accusations, alongside Cawl's borderline tech-heresy proposed during the conclave, would ultimately convince the [[Metalica]] representatives to state they will send a delegation to [[Mars]] to pursue Cawl's excommunication from the [[Cult Mechanicus]]. Magos Frenk would follow the Metallicans out.{{Fn|1e}}

