Fulke.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Fulke''' was a [[Trooper]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
When the Tanith First were deployed on [[Caligula (Hive World)|Caligula]], Fulke was part of a detachment assigned to escort a supply convoy from [[Aurelian Hive]] to [[Hive Calphernia]], driving an outrider with [[Imperial Guard Scout|Scout-Trooper]] [[Logris]] manning the guns. Fulke panicked when the convoy was attacked by bandits and tried to flee, with Logris being forced to knock him unconscious.{{Fn|2}}

Later, while the regiment was operational on the [[Forge World]] of [[Fortis Binary]], Fulke suffered a complete mental breakdown when, after months of brutal trench warfare, he awoke to the sight of local vermin devouring his rations. This culminated with him screaming and opening fire with his [[lasgun]] on full auto. He was quickly subdued by [[Murtan Feygor|Feygor]] and sentenced to a firing squad by [[Major]] [[Elim Rawne|Rawne]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[First and Only (Novel)]] — [[The Founding (Omnibus)]], Part Two, Section One
