Furiae.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Furiae''' is an [[Assault Marine|Assault]] [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] in the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
He was among its forces{{Fn|1b}} that took part in the [[First Tyrannic War]]'s [[Battle for Macragge]], where the [[Ultramarines]] defended their [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]] from [[Hive Fleet Behemoth]].{{Fn|1}} As the battle raged, the [[Chapter]] set up a defensive cordon against the [[Tyranids]], which the [[Xenos]] attacked in great numbers.{{Fn|1a}} When the section protected by [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Octavian (Chapter Ancient)|Octavian]] came under increasing pressure, Furiae and a handful of [[Assault Marine]]s were sent to aid them. The two squads then worked together to combat the Tyranids and they then launched a successful counteroffensive, that regained the ground Octavian had lost to Hive Fleet Behemoth.{{Fn|1b}}

