Furnous.wikitext:
{{IronHandsPortal}}
{{otheruses|USE=Dreadnought|OTHERUSE=Iron Father|OTHERPAGE=Furnous (Iron Father)}}
'''Furnous''' is a [[Venerable Dreadnought]] of the [[Raukaan Clan]] of the [[Iron Hands]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
[[Image:Furnous.jpg|thumb|right|Furnous{{Fn|1}}]]
Once an [[Iron Father]], Furnous was mortally wounded amid the demise of the [[Traitor Titan Legion|Traitor Titan]] ''[[Angron's Fist]]''. Dragged from the nuclear fires of the Titan's destruction, Furnous was subsequently entombed within a [[Dreadnought]] suit. Furnous has fought to prove himself worthy of the "honour" of Dreadnought entombment for almost 4,000 years since.{{Fn|1}}

The Venerable Dreadnought has taken part in Iron Hand victories on [[Dawnbreak]], [[Foredecca]], [[Helmgaard]], [[Thenoth's World]], and [[Nightmare Spire]]. Furnous’ seniority among the Dreadnoughts of clan company Raukaan is clear, his wisdom and counsel attended by the company’s leaders in all matters of strategy and war. When Raukaan march to battle, Furnous often forms his Dreadnought brethren around him in an unstoppable spearhead, and the former Chaplain bellows canticles of war as he kills, devoting each fallen foe to the [[Emperor]] and the [[Omnissiah]] alike.{{Fn|1}}

Sometime after the [[Great Rift]]'s creation, Furnous became a [[Redemptor Dreadnought]]. He is now currently serving in strike force '''Wrath of Medusa''', which has been sent to combat a suspected [[Xenos]] insurrection across the [[Mining World|mining worlds]] of the [[Glassic Strait]].{{Fn|2}}

