Furrian.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Furrian''' was a [[Guardsman]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
Furrian was born on [[Tanith]] and grew up in the same town as his fellow Guardsman [[Brostin]]. Both also shared an unhealthy obsession with fire; when they enlisted with the [[Tanith Regiments]] they both became [[Special Weapons Trooper]]s, armed with [[Imperial Flamer|flamers]].{{Fn|1}}

By '''771.[[M41]]''', when the Tanith First were deployed on the planet [[Phantine (Planet)|Phantine]], Furrian was attached to the [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment's]] [[Imperial Guard Platoon|second platoon]] under [[Colonel]] [[Colm Corbec|Corbec]]. However, in the assault on [[Cirenholm]], Furrian was killed after being shot in the head by a [[Blood Pact]] [[Chaos Cultist|cultist]]. As he died, a second shot detonated his flamer's fuel tanks, severely wounding [[Uclir]] and [[Orrin]].{{Fn|1}}

