Fury (Freeblade).wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
The '''Fury''' was a [[Forgotten Company]] [[Freeblade]] who took part in the [[Charadon Campaign]]. It would aid the Company's efforts in defending the [[asteroid]] [[Fortress World|fortress]] of [[Ferrovigilum]] in the [[Metalica System]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
There the [[Forgotten Company]] clashed with the [[Traitor Titan]]s of the [[Legio Morbidus]] and won several remarkable battles against the giant war machines. One such victory was the '''Battle of Titandoom Canyon''', which began when the [[Freeblades]] Fury, [[Shortsword]] and [[Firespike]] were charged with luring a Morbidus [[Titan Maniple|Maniple]] into '''Industrial Canyon 87-ZLξ'''. Though they succeeded in their task, and lured three [[Warhound]]s to the Canyon, the Fury was destroyed by the Traitors before the ambush could be launched. After the last Warhound finally entered the Canyon, the Forgotten Company attacked and destroyed the trapped Titans.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
