{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
'''Fyrri Askar''' is a veteran [[Wolf Guard Battle Leader]] in the [[Space Wolves]] [[Chapter]], who commands the [[Askar's Wolfpack]] [[Combat Patrol]] task force.{{Fn|1}}
