Having won honor and glory in countless battles, Askar now uses his experience to guide and lead his [[Askar's Wolfpack|Wolfpack]]. However he has the spirit of [[Lokyar]] and can be a solitary hunter, who uses the shadows in battle. Askar can also become driven by contempt for his foes, which will fill the [[Battle Leader]] with rigid determination. When this occurs, he will brave enemy fire in order to attack his enemies.{{Fn|1}} 

