Ga-Mesh'ra.wikitext:
{{CSMPortal}}
'''Ga-Mesh'ra''' is a [[Master of Possession]] in the [[Jade Talons]] [[Chaos Space Marine Chapter]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
He was their [[Chief Librarian]],{{Fn|1b}} when the [[Jade Talons]] were declared [[Traitoris Perdita]], during the [[War of the False Primarch]].{{Fn|1a}} Ga-Mesh'ra survived the conflict,{{Fn|1b}} but the [[Chapter]] had been left shattered by the [[Imperium]] and began to splinter apart.{{Fn|1a}} The Chief Librarian was subsequently amongst the Jade Talons,{{Fn|1b}} who followed their [[Chapter Master]] [[Sah'Al-Zhar]] into [[Heresy]], in order to save themselves. This allowed the survivors to be reborn as a [[Chaos Space Marine Chapter]]{{Fn|1c}} and Ga-Mesh'ra became the Jade Talons' [[Master of Possession]]. He now fulfills a key part in their induction process, as he uses [[psychic]] hallucinations to condition the Chapter's new warriors.{{Fn|1b}}
==Trivia==
