''Ga-Mesh'ra'', [[Sah'Al-Zhar]] and the [[Jade Talons]] were created{{Fn|1b}} by '''Adam Staincliffe'''.{{Fn|1a}} They appeared in [[White Dwarf 515]].{{Fn|1b}}

