Gabrielle Ulthran.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Gabrielle Ulthran''' is an [[Asuryani]] from the [[Ulthwe]] [[Craftworld]], who is kin to the [[Farseer]] [[Eldrad Ulthran]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
She was among{{Fn|1}} the [[Asuryani]]'s forces that invaded the [[Chinchare sub-sector]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]]. However the [[Imperium]] later launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Kith Campaign]] against the invading [[Xenos]]{{Fn|2}} and Gabrielle would become one of its priority targets. During the Campaign, she led an [[Ulthwe]] strike force and struck relentlessly without warning, against the [[Sub-sector]]'s Imperial outposts that surrounded the [[Eye of Terror]]. The Imperium would learn of her being [[Eldrad Ulthran|Eldrad]]'s kinsman from the few survivors of the attacks and its forces in the Campaign were warned to prepare to face Gabrielle again. While the Imperium believes it later killed her during a battle between their forces, this has not been confirmed.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
''Gabrielle Ulthran'' was created for the [[Dark Crusade Campaign]], by the '''Hobby Center''' staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s '''Arizona Mills''' store{{Fn|1}} in '''Tempe, Arizona, USA'''.{{Fn|3}}

