Gadatas bal Nurval.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Gadatas bal Nurval''' is a [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] in the [[Tome Keepers]]' [[3rd Company (Tome Keepers)|3rd Company]], who took part in the [[Indomitus Crusade]].{{Fn|1a}}

He served in [[Task Force XI]]'s [[Argovon Campaign]], which saw them do battle with the [[Necron]]. During the Campaign, Nurval led the 3rd [[Space Marine Company|Company]]'s forces{{Fn|1a}} that fought on [[Hishrea]]{{Fn|1b}}. He was later among the [[Imperial]] charge that advanced upon the Necron, in order to topple the two [[Dolmen Gate]]s the [[Xenos]] were using to bring reinforcements to the world. However to do that, the Task Force had to pass through Hishrea's '''Nurtheos Shore''', which was held by the Necron. In the battle that followed, Nurval sighted the [[Necron Lord|Necron's Lord]] and the Lieutenant immediately led his [[Bladeguard Veteran]]s against the Xenos commander. The outcome of their battle is not known{{Fn|1c}}, but the Imperial forces succeeded in destroying the Dolmen Gates. However Hishrea was later ordered to be evacuated, by the commanding [[Admiral]] [[Archibalda Tansk]], after a large Necron fleet arrived in the world's orbit.{{Fn|1b}}

