{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Gaebral the Willful''' was a [[Thane (House Cawdor)|Thane]] of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[House Cawdor]] in [[M40]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
He came to power after [[House Cawdor|Cawdor]]'s first [[Thane (House Cawdor)|Thane]], [[Aornath VI]], embraced the [[Redemption Cult]] and Gaebral believed the rhetoric laid down by his predecessor. The Thane was also convinced that if he listened hard enough, the whispered words of the [[Emperor]] could be heard in his head.{{Fn|1}}

