Gaen Gorvos.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
[[file:Gaen Gorvos.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Gaen Gorvos{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Gaen Gorvos''', the '''Gunk Queen''', is the [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] pauper princess and leader of [[Hive Primus]]'s [[Gorvos Clan]] crime syndicate.{{Fn|1}}  
==History==
She is also the furious and far more capable sister of [[Vunder Gorvos]] and they consider themselves to be nobility of the [[Underhive]]. However unlike her brother, who spends his time hob-nobbing with fellow faux-nobility, Gaen remains focused on earning cold-hard credits for her family. She oversees the manufacture of [[Gunk]] for the [[Gorvos Clan]] and also outfits her gangers with [[Gunk Round]]s and [[Gunk Bomb]]s, and Gaen even laces her throwing knives with the lethal stuff. These skills have not only allowed her to claim leadership of her clan, but also has led Gaen to be known as the '''Gunk Queen'''. Vunder meanwhile is considered a complete buffoon, who is despised by everyone he meets and has become a liability for his Clan. Because of this, Gaen spends a fair amount of time trying to get Vunder killed by hiring him out to various gangs who need some extra muscle. Her brother is not only oblivious to this, but has so far managed to blunder his way through each of these assassination attempts, even when Gaen tags along to “supervise”.{{Fn|1}}  

