{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a member of the [[Blood Angels]] [[Chapter]] who serves as a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] in the [[Deathwatch]].

==Biography==
A skilled swordsman even before he joined the Deathwatch, Galatael leads his [[jump pack]]-equipped [[Kill-Team]] with deadly speed and killing force, which has made them capable of dealing with any foes they face in battle. Such is their skill that his Kill-Team has become a well used precision instrument in the Deathwatch's arsenal.{{Fn|1b}}

Galatael and his Kill-Team are currently serving as part of the Deathwatch strike force led by [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Artemis]] and are aiding him in fighting the [[Harlequin]] forces led by [[Farseer]] [[Eldrad Ulthran]] on the moon of [[Port Demesnus]].{{Fn|1a}}

