[[Magos]] '''Galeo''' is an Adeptus Mechanicus [[Tech Priest]] serving as an armourer for [[Space Marines]]. In [[M42]], he is currently providing services aboard the [[Ultra Marines]] [[Strike Cruiser]], the ''[[Resilient]]''.{{Fn|1}}

Magos Galeo is an acquaintance of [[Demetrian Titus]], having provided the him and many other marines armouring services prior to Titus' remarkable feats in saving the [[Forge World]] of [[Graia]]. They would again cross paths 200 years later after Titus's return from service in the [[Death Watch]] and undergoing [[Primaris Marine]] surgery after suffering mortal wounds fighting a [[Carnifex]]. Galeo would warmly welcome Titus back into the service of the Ultra Marines warmly, speaking to one another on a first-names basis and expressing concerns about Titus' biometrics after the thoroughly invasive surgery.{{Fn|1}}

Magos Galeo occasionally makes pilgrimages to [[Olympus Mons]] on [[Mars]], hasn't had knees for 4 decades, and ingests nutrients via digestive cartridges. Galeo also marvels at the works of [[Belisarius Cawl]] and considers him a genius.{{Fn|2}}

