Ge'oph Robhyson.wikitext:
{{AdeptusCustodesPortal}}
'''Ge'oph Robhyson''' is an [[Adeptus Custodes]] [[Shield-Captain]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
[[Image:Ge'ophRobhyson.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Ge'oph Robhyson{{Fn|1}}]]
During the [[War of the Spider]], he sent several [[Astropathic]] messages to the lords of the [[Officio Assassinorum]], asking them to confirm that their forces were secretly following the [[Torchbearer Fleet]] of [[Shield-Captain]] [[Atal Tyvar]]. If they were, then Robhyson implored the Officio to contact and fight together with Tyvar's forces against their foes, [[Fabius Bile]] and [[Shriven (Warband)|The Shriven]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]]. The Shield-Captain would receive no replies to his messages, but he sent another after it became apparent that several Officio Assassins intervened during the War of the Spider's battle on [[Bairsten]]. Once more, Robhyson asked the Officio Assassinorum to work with Tyvar and questioned why they refused to do so. The Shield-Captain stated that their two sides should be officially fighting together as one, instead of separately, as the [[Imperium]] was already divided enough by the machinations of its foes. Robhyson then stated that if his messages concerning this, continued to be unanswered by the lords of the Officio Assassinorum, then he would be forced to bring his concerns to them in person.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Psychic Awakening: War of the Spider]], pg. 15 - ''Death on Bairsten: ++SIGNAL ROUSED++''

