As war enveloped [[Mars]], House Taranis remained [[Loyalist|loyal]] to the [[Imperium]]{{Fn|1b}} and its Knights later fought to defend [[Adept]] [[Koriel Zeth]]'s [[Forge Temple|forge]], [[Magma City]], from the [[Dark Mechanicum]]'s forces. With several of their Knights left inoperable at that time, the House's Knights had to deploy in teams of two and Gentran was partnered with the more experienced [[Stator]].{{Fn|1a}} However, the attacking Traitor forces heavily outnumbered the Loyalists and Gentran and most of his House died defiantly defending Magma City, before it fell.{{Fn|1b}} 

