'''Gerr Lomand, the Gorgon's Eye,''' was a [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor]] in the [[Iron Hands]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], who took part in the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was a living embodiment of his [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s resolve and had a sharp tactical foresight, honed by centuries of fighting at the [[Iron Hands]]' forefront. It became a weapon as lethal as any blade and gave the [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor]] a precise understanding of the forces he had at his command. This allowed Lomand to deploy his forces exactly where and when they would be the most effective on the battlefield. He was also no stranger to direct combat and would lead from the front, while sending his [[Spider Cyber-Familiar]] behind enemy lines. The [[Servo-Skull]] would then disrupt his foes, as Lomand fought them.{{Fn|1}} 

When the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Dropsite Massacre]] [[Shattered Legion|shattered]] the [[Iron Hands]], the [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor]]'s surviving [[Battle Brother]]s sought revenge however they could. Lomand, though, was charged with preserving what remained of his [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] instead, in order to ensure they endured into the future. To that end, he sought out to locate and reunite isolated Iron Hands forces, while also safeguarding his Battle Brothers' lives. Chief amongst Lomand's targets for reunification, was the elusive [[Space Marine Captain|Warleader]] [[Shadrak Meduson]], who had begun waging a guerrilla war against the [[Traitor]]s.{{Fn|1}}

