'''Geryon''' is a [[Contemptor Pattern Dreadnought]] of the [[Minotaurs]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|2}}

==Biography==
Geryon was a [[Space Marine Veteran Sergeant|Veteran Sergeant]] at the time of the [[Lamptan Assault]], in which he was gravely injured and taken to the Emperor's Grace.{{Fn|1}}

Interred in a [[Contemptor Pattern Dreadnought]], Geryon took part in the assault on the [[Necron]] [[Tomb Ship]] ''[[Dead Hand]]'' in the [[Orphean War#The Battle of Amarah|Amarah Void Battle]]. Teleporting aboard alongside [[Chapter Master|Lord]] [[Asterion Moloc|Moloc]], another Contemptor, and thirty [[Terminators]], his [[Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon#Power Fist|Power Fist]] was destroyed when it was parried by the blade of [[Maktlan Kutlakh]]. Severely wounded by the [[Necron Overlord|Overlord]], Geryon's life was saved when Lord Moloc intervened before the final blow was dealt. It is unknown if Geryon was swept into the void with Moloc before the tomb ship retreated, and if so if he was recovered alive.{{Fn|2}}

