Gharvil.wikitext:
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
'''Gharvil''' was a [[Watch Captain]] of the [[Deathwatch]].{{Fn|1}}

Gharvil was the ranking member of the Deathwatch aboard the [[Strike Cruiser]] ''[[Incontrovertible Truth]]'' when it was ambushed by the [[Black Legion]] as it dropped out of the [[Warp]] in the [[Erioch System]]. Gharvil ordered the launch of [[Thunderhawk Gunship|Thunderhawks]] to attempt to combat the Black Legion vessels, but the gunships were destroyed and the ''Incontrovertible Truth'' crippled.{{Fn|1}}

