Ghehart.wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Ghehart''' is a [[Black Templars]] [[Marshal (Black Templars)|Marshal]], who served in the [[Indomitus Crusade]]'s [[Battle Group Kallides]].{{Fn|1}} 

When they later fought the [[Necrons]] in the [[Pariah Nexus]], he was among its forces that clashed with the [[Xenos]] on [[Mesmoch]]. However due to being affected by the [[Stilling]], which enveloped the Nexus, the Battle Group was defeated and the order to evacuate Kallides' surviving forces there, was given. Ghehart and the Black Templars, though, fought to ensure the damaged [[Warlord Titan]] ''[[Deus Redemptor]]'', escaped from the battle.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
