Ghelf.wikitext:
{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Magos Dominus|Myrmidominus]] of the [[Adeptus Mechanicus]].{{Fn|1}}

Leading an expedition into the [[Nephilim Sector]], Ghelf was a major [[Imperial]] commander in the [[Pariah Crusade]] where he oversaw [[Fleet Primus]]' [[Battle Group Hephaestus (Fleet Primus)|Battle Group Hephaestus]].{{Fn|1}}

Ultimately, Ghelf became embroiled in his obsessive study of an ancient artifact known as the [[Shivarik's Constellation]]. Driven by maddening voices in his mind, he disabled the systems safety regulators and caused an implosion that created a [[Warp]] portal from which the forces of [[Vashtorr]] emerged.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Crusade: Pariah Nexus]], pgs. 40-43
