Ghelt.wikitext:
{{RavenGuardPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Raven Guard]] [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] active during the [[Horus Heresy]] and was among the remnants of his [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] to escape the aftermath of the [[Dropsite Massacre]].{{Fn|1}}

He was later given command of a [[Dark Fury]] squadron and took part in numerous battles against the [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]]' forces, including the [[Battle of Yarant]]. During that battle Ghelt led his squadron in several successful assassination strikes against the Traitors, among them being the death of the [[World Eaters]] [[Lieutenant (Space Marine)|Lieutenant-Commander]] [[Nigh Vash Delerax]].{{Fn|1}}

