Gheret Rogge.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Gheret Rogge''' was the [[Planetary Governor|High Lord]] of the [[Imperial]] world of [[Aumet]] in late [[M41]].{{Fn|1}}

Following the [[Second War for Armageddon]], [[Commissar]] [[Sebastian Yarrick]] led an Imperial pursuit force in an attempt to hunt down and kill [[Ghazghkull Mag Uruk Thraka]], the [[Ork]] [[Ork Warlord|Warlord]] responsible for the war. During his hunt, the Imperials stopped off at Aumet in order to recruit more soldiers for the operation. High Lord Rogge agreed to contribute the [[Aumet 23rd Armoured]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]] to Yarrick's crusade; the regiment was commanded by [[Colonel]] [[Kelner Rogge]], Gheret's sixth son.{{Fn|1}}

